  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Support to APRA through AfDB - Appraisal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal. The Accelerated Partnership for Renewables in Africa (APRA) consists of climate ambitious African countries (Kenya, Ethiopia, Rwanda, Namibia, Zimbabwe and Sierra Leone). A substantial part of Danish support to APRA will be implemented through a new grant of DKK 100 million to the African Development Bank&apos;s (AfDB) fund for Sustainable Energy Fund for Africa (SEFA). This funding will cover the appraisal of said grant.</narrative>
  </description>
